ay lock up and others may stop running but all compressors are damaged if there are no freon going through them when they are running. now it may be common for your heat pump to get topped off every now and then since your technician may take a little each time when they service it and that might be why your losing it but someone would have noticed the failure or leak by then.plus with r-22 phasing out there is a chance that you may need a replacement since its hard to find. therefore you need to waver the cost of repair to the cost of a new one i myself would choose a new unit giving the price of an expensive leak change.\n\u2014END WEB PAGE CONTENT\u2014\n\nInstructions\nSplit this problem into steps:\n\nConsider the underlying intent of the search.\n\nMeasure how well the content matches a likely intent of the query (M).\nMeasure how trustworthy the web page is (T).\nConsider the aspects above and the relative importance of each, and decide on a final score (O).\n\nProduce a JSON object scores without providing any reasoning.\nExample: {\"M\": 2, \"T\": 1, \"O\": 1}", "llm_response": "{\"M\": 0, \"T\": 1, \"O\": 0}", "llm_score": {"id": "UUID('f284e079-8f33-4445-9b50-8b205f314357')", "label": 0, "confidence": null, "rationale": null}, "event": "judgement_complete", "run_type": "official", "run_name": "noise-3-ensemble-3-phi-4-multimodal-instruct-resume-1.2", "cli": "infer", "level": "debug", "timestamp": "2026-01-14T10:44:31.596115Z"}
